{
  "meta": {
    "title": "Dine with D$ — component library",
    "source": "../index.html",
    "note": "Each entry is harvested from the running production mockup, so the markup and CSS are the production ones — nothing here is redrawn by hand. 'state' is applied through window.GHA_MOCK before the element named by 'sel' is lifted out of the page. Add an entry and re-run export.mjs to get a new component.",
